        rules: {
          objective: 'In positive contracts, take at least 36 of 70 card points. Negative contracts have specific objectives like winning no tricks or exact trick counts.',
          gameplay: 'Bidding follows the graduated (Graden) structure. Players bid contracts in ascending order of value. After winning bid, declarer may call a king for partner, exchange with talon, and make announcements. Must follow suit, play tarock if void, highest tarock wins.',
          keyRules: [
            '54-card deck: 22 tarocks + 8 cards in each of 4 suits',
            'Card values: Kings=5, SkÃ¼s/XXI/I=5, Queens=4, Knights=3, Jacks=2, Others=1',
