            'Call a King to find partner (unless in talon/own hand)',
            'Must follow suit, play tarock if void',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        strategy: {
          basic: 'Focus on collecting high-value cards (kings, honours). In positive contracts, 36 points is the threshold - track your progress toward this goal.',
          intermediate: 'Talon selection is crucial. Evaluate both packets carefully before choosing. When calling a king, consider which suit you need help in.',
          advanced: 'Master the announcement strategy. Announcing bonuses doubles their value but commits you to achieving them. In negative contracts (Bettel, Piccolo), the strategy inverts - you must carefully lose tricks or win exactly the right number.',
          tips: [
            'The SkÃ¼s is the highest trump but can be lost to strategic play - protect it.',
            'In Rufer, watch for the called king to appear - this reveals your partner.',
            'Card counting is essential - track which trumps have been played.',
            'Consider the risk/reward of Sechserdreier carefully - the penalty for losing is significant.',
          ],
